{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Foy3CJVGKg3fuDCfswnZ1Y","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# R10 — Backend review — Phase 1 identity substrate\n2\t\n3\t**Review date:** 2026-05-17\n4\t**Reviewer:** R10 task executor (advanced model class)\n5\t**Spec anchor:** [Phase 1: Unified Identity Model](../../2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-plan.md#phase-1-unified-identity-model)\n6\t**Tasks reviewed:** T06, T07, T08, T09\n7\t\n8\tThis review certifies that the Phase 1 unified-identity substrate satisfies the\n9\tspec deliverables and the Cadres coding standard so Phase 2 (event log) can\n10\tbuild on stable references that survive renames, moves, branch changes, and\n11\tlegacy compatibility paths.\n12\t\n13\t## Spec alignment\n14\t\n15\tThe Phase 1 spec lists five deliverables and three definition-of-done items.\n16\tEach row cites the artifact and the literal symbol or test name that proves it.\n17\t\n18\t| Spec deliverable | Evidence (file:line — symbol / test) |\n19\t|---|---|\n20\t| Stable ids — File | `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/identity/kinds.rs:8` — `pub struct FileId { workspace_id, repo_relative_path, content_hash }` |\n21\t| Stable ids — Symbol | `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/identity/kinds.rs:15` — `pub struct SymbolId { file, qualified_name, byte_offset, kind }` |\n22\t| Stable ids — Doc | `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/identity/kinds.rs:23` — `pub struct DocId { workspace_id, repo_relative_path, content_hash }` |\n23\t| Stable ids — Section | `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/identity/kinds.rs:30` — `pub struct SectionId { doc, heading_path, byte_offset }` |\n24\t| Stable ids — Event | `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/identity/kinds.rs:37` — `pub struct EventId { workspace_id, ulid }` |\n25\t| Stable ids — Memory | `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/identity/kinds.rs:43` — `pub struct MemoryId { workspace_id, ulid }` |\n26\t| Stable ids — ContextHandle | `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/identity/kinds.rs:49` — `pub 