{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RpA3aVFEQ5iGkC2E4ge8h4","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /home/pete/cadres/lattice/daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/contract_tests/mod.rs has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"97e40997-f38f-4628-bdcd-a9758dda27fa","uuid":"635aa6d1-e724-45eb-83b4-b1d7ca4a27ef","timestamp":"2026-05-17T07:40:00.449Z","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"/home/pete/cadres/lattice/daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/contract_tests/mod.rs","oldString":"#[cfg(test)]\npub mod identity_event_memory;","newString":"#[cfg(test)]\npub mod identity_event_memory;\n#[cfg(test)]\nmod identity_event_memory_support;","originalFile":"//! Cross-layer contract tests for the cognitive workspace substrates.\n//!\n//! These tests live above any individual substrate so they can exercise the\n//! end-to-end round-trip across the three first-class substrates the spec\n//! names — workspace identity, event log, and memory graph — and prove they\n//! compose. Each individual layer is covered by its own per-substrate review\n//! gate (R10 for identity, R18 for events, R25 for memory). The R26 contract\n//! gate uses the tests in this module to certify the cross-layer contracts\n//! enumerated in `docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-plan.md`\n//! `## Design Thesis` (three substrates sharing identity, storage, and\n//! ranking primitives).\n\n#[cfg(test)]\npub mod identity_event_memory;\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":12,"oldLines":3,"newStart":12,"newLines":5,"lines":[" "," #[cfg(test)]"," pub mod identity_event_memory;","+#[cfg(test)]","+mod identity_event_memory_support;"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
